msgid "By default the lockout counts the direct connection IP, which cannot be faked. Only turn this on if your site is reachable ONLY through Cloudflare or a proxy — it then reads the real visitor IP from the proxy header (CF-Connecting-IP / X-Forwarded-For). Do NOT enable it on a normally-hosted site: those headers can be forged, letting an attacker dodge the lockout or get an innocent visitor locked out."
msgstr "默认情况下，锁定功能统计的是直连 IP，该 IP 无法伪造。仅当您的网站只能通过 Cloudflare 或代理访问时才启用此选项——启用后它会从代理请求头（CF-Connecting-IP / X-Forwarded-For）读取访客的真实 IP。请勿在普通托管的网站上启用它：这些请求头可以被伪造，攻击者可借此躲避锁定，或使无辜访客被误锁。"

