msgstr "正在发送…"

msgid "Sends one event to your analytics each time a visitor taps a contact link — phone, SMS, email, Zalo, Messenger, Telegram, WhatsApp, Viber, Line, WeChat, TikTok, Maps and the rest. Any other chat button is recorded under its own site name, so Instagram, Shopee, Signal and anything you add later are covered without waiting for an update. Phone, SMS, email and Viber links count anywhere on the site, including inside your posts; the others count inside the chat widgets, so an article full of outbound links does not flood the report. Nothing is stored on your site and no personal data is involved."
msgstr "每当访客点击联系链接时——电话、短信、邮件、Zalo、Messenger、Telegram、WhatsApp、Viber、Line、WeChat、TikTok、地图及其他——都会向您的分析工具发送一个事件。任何其他聊天按钮都会以其自身的站点名称记录，因此 Instagram、Shopee、Signal 以及您日后添加的任何渠道，无需等待更新即可被覆盖。电话、短信、邮件和 Viber 链接在网站任何位置均会计入，包括文章内部；其他渠道则仅在聊天组件内计入，因此充满外链的文章不会淹没报告。您的网站不会存储任何内容，也不涉及任何个人数据。"

msgid "Sent to %s. Now go and look — and do not close this page, because the useful part is what you find."
msgstr "已发送到 %s。现在请前去查看——并且不要关闭此页面，因为有用的部分正是您所发现的内容。"

msgid "Sent. Check %s — if nothing arrives, the channel is not working even though the site thinks it is."
msgstr "已发送。请检查 %s——如果没有收到，即使网站认为渠道正常，实际上它也没有工作。"

msgid "Sent: %s"
msgstr "已发送：%s"

msgid "Server errors, including absolute paths."
msgstr "服务器错误，包括绝对路径。"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

msgid "Services panel (mobile)"
msgstr "服务面板（移动端）"

msgid "Settings are grouped by what they do. Pick a group below, or search for a setting by name in the panel on the right."
msgstr "设置已按功能分组。请在下方选择一个分组，或在右侧面板中按名称搜索某项设置。"

msgid "Settings → WooCommerce → “Configure order notifications to be sent to Telegram”"
msgstr "设置 → WooCommerce → “配置要发送到 Telegram 的订单通知”"

msgid "Sharpen (blur to clear)"
msgstr "锐化（从模糊到清晰）"

msgid "Show a “Decline” button"
msgstr "显示“拒绝”按钮"

msgid "Show columns"
msgstr "显示列"

msgid "Show new keys to paste"
msgstr "显示可粘贴的新密钥"

msgid "Showing the first %1$d of %2$d — keep typing to narrow it down."
msgstr "正在显示前 %1$d 项，共 %2$d 项——继续输入以缩小范围。"

msgid "Shows a small cookie notice in the corner so your site meets privacy rules. To use: turn on the switch, type the notice and your policy-page link, then choose which side it appears on."
msgstr "在角落显示一个小型 Cookie 提示，以使您的网站符合隐私规定。使用方法：开启开关，输入提示文字和您政策页面的链接，然后选择它出现的一侧。"

msgid "Shows a thin notice bar across the very top of every page — handy for a promotion, a hotline, or a delivery note. To use: turn on the switch, type your message, then choose the background colour."
msgstr "在每个页面的最顶部显示一条细长的提示栏——适用于促销、热线电话或配送说明。使用方法：开启开关，输入您的消息，然后选择背景颜色。"

msgid "Shows an eye-catching popup in the middle of the screen when someone opens your site — great for a sale, an announcement or a poster. To use: turn on the switch, pick a layout below, add an image / title / content, then set how many hours before it shows again."
msgstr "当有人打开您的网站时，在屏幕中央显示一个醒目的弹窗——非常适合促销、公告或海报。使用方法：开启开关，在下方选择一种布局，添加图片/标题/内容，然后设定多少小时后再次显示。"

msgid "Side of the site"
msgstr "网站的一侧"

msgid "Signature"
msgstr "签名"

msgid "Signing keys are in wp-config.php, not the database"
msgstr "签名密钥保存在 wp-config.php 中，而非数据库中"

msgid "Site"
msgstr "网站"

msgid "Site is behind Cloudflare or a proxy (use the real visitor IP)"
msgstr "网站位于 Cloudflare 或代理之后（使用访客的真实 IP）"

msgid "Site search"
msgstr "站内搜索"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "Skype (service closed)"
msgstr "Skype（服务已关闭）"

msgid "Slide"
msgstr "滑动"

msgid "Slide down"
msgstr "向下滑动"

msgid "Slide in from left"
msgstr "从左侧滑入"

msgid "Slide in from right"
msgstr "从右侧滑入"

msgid "Slide transition (GLightbox)"
msgstr "幻灯片切换效果（GLightbox）"

msgid "Slide up"
msgstr "向上滑动"

msgid "Slow down to 60 seconds (safe)"
msgstr "减慢至 60 秒（安全）"

msgid "Snippets"
msgstr "代码片段"

msgid "So this sends you a short message on a schedule, with a number on it, even when everything is fine. Numbers that skip mean messages were sent and never reached you. A message that arrives late means nothing was running the schedule. Nothing at all means something stopped it — and that is the one you can only notice from outside the site, which is why each message tells you when to expect the next."
msgstr "因此，即便一切正常，这也会按计划给您发送一条带编号的简短消息。编号出现跳跃，意味着消息已发出但从未送达您。消息迟到，意味着没有任何东西在运行该计划。什么都没有，则意味着有什么阻止了它——而这正是您只有在网站之外才能察觉的情况，这也是为什么每条消息都会告诉您下一条预计何时到达。"

msgid "Soft pastel"
msgstr "柔和粉彩"

msgid "Somebody has asked for this path %d times."
msgstr "有人已请求过此路径 %d 次。"

msgid "Something changed what you approved, without going through this screen."
msgstr "有东西更改了您批准的内容，且未经过此界面。"

msgid "Something changed — see the notice on any Horse Tools screen"
msgstr "有内容发生了变化——请见任意 Horse Tools 界面上的提示"

msgid "Something went wrong. Please try again."
msgstr "出现问题，请重试。"

msgid "Sortable columns"
msgstr "可排序的列"

msgid "Sorting, search and pagination appear on the published page."
msgstr "排序、搜索和分页会显示在已发布的页面上。"

msgid "Speed"
msgstr "速度"

msgid "Spots visitors who have an ad-blocker turned on and shows them a message asking to switch it off. To use: turn on the switch, type a title and message, then pick the button colours below."
msgstr "识别出开启了广告拦截器的访客，并向其显示一条要求关闭它的消息。使用方法：开启开关，输入标题和消息内容，然后在下方选择按钮颜色。"

msgid "Stack into cards on mobile"
msgstr "在移动端堆叠为卡片"

msgid "Start fetching a few important files immediately (the LCP image, a web font, the main CSS). The type is detected from the file extension. Do not preload many files — it competes with everything else for bandwidth."
msgstr "立即开始获取几个重要文件（LCP 图片、网页字体、主 CSS）。类型通过文件扩展名判断。请勿预加载过多文件——这会与其他一切争抢带宽。"

msgid "Starting…"
msgstr "正在启动…"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Step 1 —"
msgstr "步骤 1 —"

msgid "Step 2 —"
msgstr "步骤 2 —"

msgid "Step 3 —"
msgstr "步骤 3 —"

msgid "Still reading your content"
msgstr "仍在读取您的内容"

msgid "Still reading your content. Come back in a minute."
msgstr "仍在读取您的内容。请稍候片刻再回来查看。"

msgid "Still reading your content: %1$d of %2$d. Come back in a minute."
msgstr "仍在读取您的内容：%1$d / %2$d。请稍候片刻再回来查看。"

msgid "Striped rows"
msgstr "斑马纹行"

msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

msgid "Stylesheets to keep render-blocking (one per line — a handle or part of the URL). Put your main theme CSS here if you don’t have critical CSS yet."
msgstr "需要保持阻塞渲染的样式表（每行一个——句柄或 URL 的一部分）。如果您还没有关键 CSS，请将主题的主 CSS 放在这里。"

msgid "Swing"
msgstr "摇摆"

msgid "Switch on Horse Tools two-factor authentication (Security tab) before using PHP snippets."
msgstr "使用 PHP 代码片段之前，请先开启 Horse Tools 的双重验证（“安全”标签页）。"

msgid "Sync from Sheet"
msgstr "从表格同步"

msgid "Synced"
msgstr "已同步"

msgid "Syncing…"
msgstr "正在同步…"

msgid "THEY DO NOT — something changed them without going through the screens"
msgstr "不再一致——有东西在未经过这些界面的情况下更改了它们"

msgid "Table"
msgstr "表格"

msgid "Table %d"
msgstr "表格 %d"

msgid "Table of contents"
msgstr "目录"

msgid "Table ready — click to edit."
msgstr "表格已就绪——点击即可编辑。"

msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

msgid "Tag Manager is installed on this site. If you already built click tags there — a trigger on tel: links, on zalo.me, on m.me — switching this on records the same click twice, once under your own event name and once as contact_phone. Open your container, check whether such tags exist, and pause either those or this setting. Keep whichever one also fires your Google Ads conversions; this setting does not."
msgstr "本站已安装 Tag Manager。如果您已在其中构建了点击类标签——针对 tel: 链接、zalo.me、m.me 的触发器——开启此设置会使同一次点击被记录两次：一次以您自己的事件名称，一次作为 contact_phone。请打开您的容器，检查是否存在此类标签，然后暂停其中一方或此设置。请保留能同时触发您 Google Ads 转化的那一方；此设置不会触发转化。"

msgid "Take back the ticked ones"
msgstr "收回已勾选的项"

msgid "Take the link away, keep the words"
msgstr "移除链接，保留文字"

msgid "Teal"
msgstr "青色"

msgid "Telegram (chat %s — the one paired for two-factor recovery)"
msgstr "Telegram（聊天 %s——已配对用于双重验证恢复的那个）"

msgid "Telegram (chat %s)"
msgstr "Telegram（聊天 %s）"

msgid "Telegram chat ID for security messages (optional)"
msgstr "用于安全消息的 Telegram Chat ID（可选）"

msgid "Telegram recovery is ON but this site has no bot token yet, so no recovery code can be sent. Add a bot token in the %1$s module (the “Configure order notifications to be sent to Telegram” section) — it is easy to miss because it lives there, not here — then each user pastes their own chat ID on their profile."
msgstr "Telegram 恢复功能已开启，但本站尚未设置机器人令牌，因此无法发送恢复代码。请在 %1$s 模块中添加机器人令牌（“配置要发送到 Telegram 的订单通知”部分）——由于它位于那里而非此处，很容易被忽略——然后每位用户在自己的个人资料中粘贴各自的 Chat ID。"

msgid "Telegram recovery is turned on but this site has no bot token yet, so no code can be sent. Add a bot token under %s, then reload this page."
msgstr "Telegram 恢复功能已开启，但本站尚未设置机器人令牌，因此无法发送代码。请在 %s 下添加机器人令牌，然后重新加载此页面。"

msgid "Telegram recovery isn’t fully set up on this site yet — ask the site admin, or just use email or a backup code instead."
msgstr "本站尚未完全配置好 Telegram 恢复功能——请咨询网站管理员，或直接改用邮件或备用代码。"

msgid "Telegram returned no updates (the bot may use a webhook, or the token is wrong)."
msgstr "Telegram 未返回任何更新（机器人可能使用了 webhook，或令牌有误）。"

msgid "Tell me the site is still being watched"
msgstr "告诉我网站仍在被监测"

msgid "Tell the browser to start the DNS + TCP + TLS handshake to external hosts early (fonts, CDN, analytics), so their files arrive sooner. Adds preconnect and dns-prefetch hints to the page head."
msgstr "让浏览器提前开始与外部主机（字体、CDN、分析）握手 DNS + TCP + TLS，使这些文件能更快到达。会在页面 head 中添加 preconnect 和 dns-prefetch 提示。"

msgid "Temporarily close the site with a “under maintenance” notice while you make changes. You (and other logged-in admins) still see the site normally, so you can work in peace."
msgstr "在您进行修改期间，用“维护中”提示暂时关闭网站。您（以及其他已登录的管理员）仍会看到网站正常运行，因此可以安心操作。"

msgid "Test message from %s"
msgstr "来自 %s 的测试消息"

msgid "Test the site after turning this on. If something that must work before interaction breaks (a hero slider, a cookie bar), add its handle or file name to a list below. Do not use together with “Delay JS” in another optimiser."
msgstr "开启此项后请测试网站。如果某个必须在交互前就正常工作的功能出现故障（首屏轮播图、Cookie 提示栏），请将其句柄或文件名添加到下方列表中。请勿与其他优化插件中的“延迟 JS”同时使用。"

msgid "Test these keys against Google"
msgstr "针对 Google 测试这些密钥"

msgid "That code is not right."
msgstr "该验证码不正确。"

msgid "That does not look like a Google Sheets link."
msgstr "这看起来不像是 Google 表格链接。"

msgid "That is not an email address."
msgstr "这不是一个电子邮件地址。"

msgid "That snippet no longer exists."
msgstr "该代码片段已不存在。"

msgid "That was me — line them up again"
msgstr "是我操作的——重新排列它们"

msgid "The PHP snippet \"%s\" stopped the page it ran on, so Horse Tools switched it off. Edit it and switch it back on when it is fixed."
msgstr "PHP 代码片段“%s”导致其所在页面停止运行，因此 Horse Tools 已将其关闭。请修复后重新编辑并将其重新开启。"

msgid "The Secret key box is empty, so the check is skipped entirely and reCAPTCHA is doing nothing at all."
msgstr "密钥（Secret key）字段为空，因此验证被完全跳过，reCAPTCHA 实际上什么都没做。"

msgid "The Site key box is empty."
msgstr "站点密钥（Site key）字段为空。"

msgid "The account name for this service is the literal word “%user%”. It is not your email address, and putting your address there is why it says the password is wrong."
msgstr "该服务的账户名就是字面意义上的“%user%”一词。它并非您的电子邮件地址，而将您的地址填在那里，正是系统提示密码错误的原因。"

msgid "The answer is matched ignoring case and surrounding spaces. Remember it — if you ever forget it you can still get back in by renaming the plugin folder over FTP to switch the plugin off."
msgstr "答案比对时会忽略大小写及首尾空格。请牢记它——万一您忘记了，仍可通过 FTP 重命名插件目录来关闭插件，从而重新进入。"

msgid "The check-in message is on but has never been sent. Until one arrives you do not know the channel works."
msgstr "签到消息功能已开启，但从未发送过。在收到一条之前，您无法确定该渠道是否正常。"

msgid "The code is how the site tells your chat apart from everyone else’s — it finds only the chat that sent it. Recovery codes then reach your own Telegram, not the admin. (You can also type the chat ID number in manually.)"
msgstr "该代码是网站用来区分您的聊天与其他所有人聊天的方式——它只会找到发送该代码的那个聊天。恢复代码随后会送达您自己的 Telegram，而非管理员。（您也可以手动输入 Chat ID 号码。）"

msgid "The first one goes out as soon as you save, so you find out straight away whether the channel works."
msgstr "第一条会在您保存后立即发出，因此您能立刻知道该渠道是否正常工作。"

msgid "The form below asks eight questions. Seven of them have exactly one right answer once you know which service you are using, and the eighth is a password. Choose here and the seven fill themselves in — you are left with the one thing nothing can guess."
msgstr "下方表单会提出八个问题。一旦您知道自己使用的是哪种服务，其中七个问题就各自只有一个正确答案，第八个则是密码。在此处选择服务，那七项便会自行填好——只剩下那唯一一件任何人都无法猜到的东西。"

msgid "The last check-in message could not be sent: %s"
msgstr "最后一条签到消息未能发送：%s"

msgid "The last check-in message went out %s ago, which is later than it should be. Nothing has been running the schedule."
msgstr "最后一条签到消息是在 %s 前发出的，比预期要晚。没有任何东西在运行该计划。"

msgid "The last one could not be sent — Security tab → Check-in"
msgstr "最后一条未能发送——“安全”标签页 → 签到"

msgid "The link still works for a reader and stops passing any SEO value — which is the whole reason a link like that is worth paying for. Nothing in your posts is changed; only what gets printed."
msgstr "该链接对读者而言依旧有效，但不再传递任何 SEO 价值——这正是此类链接值得付费的全部原因所在。您文章中的任何内容都不会被更改；改变的只是输出的结果。"

msgid "The most powerful but riskiest speed option. Without the Critical CSS below, the page can flash unstyled for a moment (FOUC). Paste your above-the-fold CSS, or keep the main theme stylesheet in the exclusion list. Test the front end carefully, and don’t combine it with another plugin that also optimises CSS delivery."
msgstr "最强大但也最具风险的速度选项。若没有下方的关键 CSS，页面可能会瞬间出现无样式闪烁（FOUC）。请粘贴您首屏区域的 CSS，或将主主题样式表保留在排除列表中。请仔细测试前台效果，且不要与另一个同样优化 CSS 加载的插件一起使用。"

msgid "The page carries no analytics at all yet, so there is nowhere for a click to be recorded. Install Site Kit by Google, or any GA4 plugin, and this setting starts working on its own with nothing further to configure."
msgstr "该页面目前完全没有任何分析工具，因此点击无处可记录。请安装 Site Kit by Google 或任意 GA4 插件，此设置便会自动开始工作，无需进一步配置。"

msgid "The request itself failed."
msgstr "请求本身失败了。"

msgid "The security question below the password was left empty."
msgstr "密码下方的安全问题被留空了。"

msgid "The sheet appears to be empty."
msgstr "该表格似乎是空的。"

msgid "The sheet is too large (over 1 MB of CSV)."
msgstr "该表格过大（CSV 超过 1 MB）。"

msgid "The sheet must be shared as “Anyone with the link can view”. With auto-refresh on, the table updates itself from the sheet."
msgstr "该表格必须共享为“知道链接的任何人均可查看”。开启自动刷新后，表格会自动从该表格中更新。"

msgid "The site handed it over successfully. That is not the same as it arriving — if the numbers you receive skip, the channel is dropping them."
msgstr "网站已成功将其移交出去。这与“已送达”并非一回事——如果您收到的编号出现跳跃，说明该渠道正在丢失部分消息。"

msgid "The username is the literal word “apikey”, not your address."
msgstr "用户名就是字面意义上的“apikey”一词，而非您的地址。"

msgid "The username is the literal word “resend”, not your address. You must add and verify your domain before it will send as you."
msgstr "用户名就是字面意义上的“resend”一词，而非您的地址。您必须先添加并验证您的域名，它才能以您的名义发送邮件。"

msgid "The username is the postmaster address Mailgun shows on your sending domain, not your login."
msgstr "用户名是 Mailgun 在您发信域名上显示的 postmaster 地址，而非您的登录名。"

msgid "Theme colour"
msgstr "主题颜色"

msgid "There are files in your site’s folder that anyone can download."
msgstr "您网站目录中存在任何人都能下载的文件。"

msgid "These are correct — remember them"
msgstr "这些是正确的——请牢记它们"

msgid "These are the phone numbers, Zalo, Messenger links and email addresses currently in your settings. Check them, then confirm — after that you will be told if any of them ever change. Changing the hotline on a shop is the most direct attack there is, and the quietest."
msgstr "这些是您设置中当前的电话号码、Zalo、Messenger 链接和电子邮件地址。请检查它们，然后确认——之后只要其中任何一项发生变化，您都会收到通知。更改店铺的热线电话，是最直接也最悄无声息的一种攻击手段。"

msgid "These contact details appear in your content. Confirm them and you will be told if a new one ever turns up in a post — which is what happens when somebody edits an old article to put their own number in it."
msgstr "这些联系方式出现在您的内容中。请确认它们，此后只要文章中出现新的联系方式，您都会收到通知——这正是有人编辑旧文章、将自己的号码塞进去时会发生的情况。"

msgid "These two addresses do not match, and that is enough to stop your mail."
msgstr "这两个地址不一致，仅此一点就足以阻止您的邮件发送。"

msgid "They no longer match — see the banner at the top of any Horse Tools screen"
msgstr "它们已不再一致——请见任意 Horse Tools 界面顶部的横幅"

msgid "This account uses two-factor authentication; XML-RPC password login is disabled."
msgstr "此账户使用双重验证；已禁用通过 XML-RPC 的密码登录。"

msgid "This could not be checked from here, so the instructions are shown just in case. To find out whether they apply to you: open your site, press F12, and type gtag in the console. An answer of \"function\" means you have nothing to do; \"undefined\" means follow the steps below."
msgstr "此项无法从此处检查，因此这里仅显示相关说明以备不时之需。要判断它们是否适用于您：打开您的网站，按 F12，然后在控制台中输入 gtag。返回“function”表示您无需操作；返回“undefined”表示需要按照下方步骤操作。"

msgid "This host does not let the plugin read DNS, so none of the checks below can be made. That is not the same as everything being in order."
msgstr "此主机不允许插件读取 DNS，因此下方的检查项均无法执行。这并不代表一切正常。"

msgid "This is a test message from %s."
msgstr "这是来自 %s 的测试消息。"

msgid "This list is incomplete."
msgstr "此列表不完整。"

msgid "This never touches what is stored. Switch it off and every link is back as it was on the next page load."
msgstr "这从不会触及已存储的内容。将其关闭后，下次加载页面时每个链接都会恢复原状。"

msgid "This section could not be displayed. The rest of the screen still works."
msgstr "此部分内容无法显示。界面其余部分仍可正常使用。"

msgid "This server cannot reach any other mail server, so nothing it sends can ever be delivered. WordPress hands each message to a local mail program, that program accepts it — which is why every screen says “sent” — and then finds the way out closed. The message waits in a queue nobody reads, and there is no bounce, because a bounce would have to leave by the same door."
msgstr "此服务器无法连接到任何其他邮件服务器，因此它发送的任何内容都无法被送达。WordPress 会将每条消息交给本地邮件程序，该程序会接受它——这就是为什么每个界面都显示“已发送”——然后才发现出口是关闭的。消息会在无人查看的队列中等待，也不会有退信，因为退信必须从同一扇门离开。"

msgid "This server does not read .htaccess files, so nothing is hiding this one but its name. Horse Tools now stores these as .php files that stop on their first line, which works on every server."
msgstr "此服务器不会读取 .htaccess 文件，因此除了文件名之外，没有任何东西能隐藏这个文件。Horse Tools 现在将这些文件保存为 .php 文件，并在第一行就终止执行，这在任何服务器上都有效。"

msgid "This server sends mail from an address with no name attached to it (%s). Gmail and Yahoo both take that as the mark of a machine nobody set up to send mail, and Yahoo refuses it outright — which looks from here exactly like the message vanishing, because the refusal happens at the far end and the bounce goes somewhere you never read."
msgstr "此服务器发送的邮件所用地址没有绑定名称（%s）。Gmail 和 Yahoo 都将其视为一台无人配置用于发信的机器的标志，而 Yahoo 会直接拒收——从这里看来，这与消息凭空消失一模一样，因为拒收发生在对方那一端，退信也发往您从未查看的地方。"

msgid "This site cannot see its own public address — it sits behind a proxy or a load balancer — so the checks above that depend on knowing it were skipped rather than guessed at."
msgstr "此网站无法得知自己的公开地址——它位于代理或负载均衡器之后——因此上方那些依赖此信息的检查项被跳过，而非凭空猜测。"

msgid "This site has WordPress's built-in file editor switched off (DISALLOW_FILE_EDIT) — good. PHP snippets still work, because they carry their own protections: two-factor unlock, a syntax check before saving, auto-disable on a crash, and code signing. To switch them off as well, add HORSETOOLS_NO_PHP to wp-config.php."
msgstr "此网站已关闭 WordPress 内置的文件编辑器（DISALLOW_FILE_EDIT）——很好。PHP 代码片段依然可用，因为它们自带保护机制：双重验证解锁、保存前的语法检查、崩溃时自动禁用，以及代码签名。若要一并关闭它们，请在 wp-config.php 中添加 HORSETOOLS_NO_PHP。"

msgid "This site has no valid admin email address."
msgstr "此网站没有有效的管理员电子邮件地址。"

msgid "This site has no way to reach you: no Telegram bot, and no valid admin email address."
msgstr "此网站没有任何方式能联系到您：既没有 Telegram 机器人，也没有有效的管理员电子邮件地址。"

msgid "This site sets DISALLOW_FILE_MODS, so running PHP from the database is not allowed."
msgstr "此网站设置了 DISALLOW_FILE_MODS，因此不允许从数据库运行 PHP。"

msgid "This site’s signing keys are stored in the database, not in wp-config.php."
msgstr "此网站的签名密钥保存在数据库中，而非 wp-config.php 中。"

msgid "This snippet’s code no longer matches its signature — it was changed outside this screen and will not run. Review it and save again to re-sign it."
msgstr "此代码片段的代码已不再与其签名匹配——它在此界面之外被修改过，因此不会运行。请检查后重新保存以重新签名。"

msgid "This user has two-factor authentication ON."
msgstr "该用户的双重验证已开启。"

msgid "This web server is not on your domain’s list of allowed senders. The list says “treat anything else as suspicious” rather than “reject it”, so mail as %s will usually arrive in the spam folder."
msgstr "此 Web 服务器不在您域名的授权发信服务器列表中。该列表表示“将其余所有情况视为可疑”而非“拒绝它”，因此以 %s 发出的邮件通常会进入垃圾邮件文件夹。"

msgid "This web server is on your domain’s list of allowed senders."
msgstr "此 Web 服务器已在您域名的授权发信服务器列表中。"

msgid "Tick all on this page"
msgstr "勾选本页所有项"

msgid "Tip: to stop one specific script from ever being delayed, add the attribute data-ht-no-delay to its tag. Logged-in users are never affected."
msgstr "提示：若要让某个特定脚本永不被延迟，请在其标签中添加 data-ht-no-delay 属性。已登录用户永远不受影响。"

msgid "To check it works right now rather than waiting: open your site with %s on the end of the address, tap a contact button, and watch GA4 → Admin → DebugView. Without that flag DebugView stays empty however many times you tap, because it only lists devices that identify themselves as debug devices — which is not a fault in the buttons."
msgstr "要立即确认它是否生效而无需等待：请在网址末尾加上 %s 打开您的网站，点击一个联系按钮，然后查看 GA4 → 管理 → DebugView。若没有该标记，无论您点击多少次，DebugView 都会保持为空，因为它只列出自我标识为调试设备的设备——这并非按钮本身的缺陷。"

msgid "To use PHP snippets, switch on two-factor authentication first (Horse Tools → Overview → Security)."
msgstr "要使用 PHP 代码片段，请先开启双重验证（Horse Tools → 概览 → 安全）。"

msgid "To use PHP snippets, switch on two-factor authentication for your own account first (Users → Profile)."
msgstr "要使用 PHP 代码片段，请先为您自己的账户开启双重验证（用户 → 个人资料）。"

msgid "Too many failed attempts. Try again in about %s."
msgstr "失败尝试次数过多，请约 %s 后再试。"

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "工具"

msgid "Trust this device for 30 days"
msgstr "信任此设备 30 天"

msgid "Turn it off (uncheck stays on)"
msgstr "关闭它（取消勾选仍保持开启）"

msgid "Turn it off for this user (e.g. they lost their device)"
msgstr "为此用户关闭它（例如他们丢失了设备）"

msgid "Turn on the regular check-in message"
msgstr "开启定期签到消息"

msgid "Turned on but never sent — send a test message"
msgstr "已开启但从未发送过——发送测试消息"

msgid "Two Horse Tools protections are signed with those keys: the PHP snippet signature, which is meant to refuse code written straight into the database, and the “trusted device” cookie that skips two-factor authentication. Anyone who can read your database can read the keys, so both can be forged. Moving the keys into wp-config.php — a file — restores them."
msgstr "这些密钥用于签署 Horse Tools 的两项防护措施：PHP 代码片段签名（用于拒绝直接写入数据库的代码），以及用于跳过双重验证的“受信任设备”Cookie。任何能读取您数据库的人都能读取这些密钥，因此两者都可能被伪造。将密钥移至 wp-config.php——一个文件——即可恢复其安全性。"

msgid "Two-factor authentication"
msgstr "双重验证"

msgid "Two-factor authentication (2FA)"
msgstr "双重验证（2FA）"

msgid "Two-factor authentication is ON for your account."
msgstr "您账户的双重验证已开启。"

msgid "Type it in"
msgstr "手动输入"

msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "解锁"

msgid "Untick all"
msgstr "取消全部勾选"

msgid "Upload a file"
msgstr "上传文件"

msgid "Upload a font on the Fonts tab first, then choose where to use it here."
msgstr "请先在“字体”标签页上传一种字体，然后在此处选择在何处使用它。"

msgid "Users"
msgstr "用户"

msgid "Uses the site’s Telegram bot (configured in the WooCommerce module), but each user pastes their OWN chat ID on their profile — so a recovery code always reaches that user’s Telegram, never pooled to the admin. Users without a chat ID simply don’t see the Telegram option."
msgstr "使用网站的 Telegram 机器人（在 WooCommerce 模块中配置），但每位用户在其个人资料中粘贴的是各自“自己的”Chat ID——因此恢复代码始终会送达该用户自己的 Telegram，而绝不会汇总到管理员那里。没有 Chat ID 的用户则完全看不到 Telegram 这个选项。"

msgid "Usually a phpinfo page."
msgstr "通常是一个 phpinfo 页面。"

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "验证"

msgid "Version-control metadata exposes the source."
msgstr "版本控制元数据会暴露源代码。"

msgid "Waiting for you"
msgstr "等待您处理"

msgid "Weekly is the useful setting. Daily turns the one message that is supposed to mean something into noise within a fortnight, and once it is noise a gap in the numbering is not noticed either."
msgstr "每周是最有用的设置。每日会让原本应有意义的那条消息，在两周内变成噪音，而一旦变成噪音，编号中的缺口也就同样不会被注意到。"

msgid "What you approved is also kept outside the database"
msgstr "您批准的内容也会保存在数据库之外"

msgid "What you still have to paste: %secret%."
msgstr "您还需要粘贴的内容：%secret%。"

msgid "When a URL changes or an old link should point somewhere new, this sends visitors (and Google) straight to the right page instead of a “not found” error — so you don’t lose traffic."
msgstr "当某个 URL 发生变化，或旧链接应指向新的位置时，这会将访客（以及 Google）直接引导至正确的页面，而非“未找到”错误——这样您就不会流失流量。"

msgid "When about to leave the page"
msgstr "即将离开页面时"

msgid "When it appears"
msgstr "何时出现"

msgid "Where did it turn up?"
msgstr "它出现在哪里？"

msgid "Where it appears"
msgstr "出现在哪里"

msgid "Where it runs"
msgstr "在哪里运行"

msgid "Where this stands:"
msgstr "目前进展："

msgid "Where to get it"
msgstr "从哪里获取它"

msgid "Where to read the numbers"
msgstr "在哪里查看数字"

msgid "Where to run it"
msgstr "在哪里运行它"

msgid "Where your content links to"
msgstr "您的内容链接到哪里"

msgid "Which service should send your email?"
msgstr "应由哪个服务发送您的邮件？"

msgid "Wiggle now and then to catch the eye"
msgstr "时不时晃动以吸引注意"

msgid "WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce"

msgid "WordPress could not hand the message to the mail server at all, so it never left the site."
msgstr "WordPress 根本无法将消息交给邮件服务器，因此它从未离开过网站。"

msgid "WordPress could not hand the message to the mail server."
msgstr "WordPress 无法将消息交给邮件服务器。"

msgid "WordPress reports a message as sent once it has handed it over. That says nothing about whether it arrived, and on a great many sites it does not — the domain names which servers may send for it, the web server is not one of them, and every notification the site sends is treated as forged. Nothing in WordPress mentions this. Below is what your domain’s own records say, read live."
msgstr "WordPress 一旦将消息交出，就会将其报告为“已发送”。这并不代表它已送达，而在相当多的网站上，情况确实并非如此——域名指明了哪些服务器可以为其发信，而 Web 服务器不在其中，网站发出的每条通知都会被视为伪造。WordPress 中不会提及这一点。以下是您域名自身记录的实时读取结果。"

msgid "WordPress “Heartbeat” pings the server every 15–60 seconds (autosave, post-lock, dashboard). Slowing or limiting it cuts admin-ajax.php load, especially with several admin tabs open."
msgstr "WordPress 的“Heartbeat”每 15–60 秒向服务器发送一次心跳（自动保存、文章锁定、控制台）。放慢或限制它可以降低 admin-ajax.php 的负载，在打开多个管理标签页时尤其明显。"

msgid "Worth a second look"
msgstr "值得再看一眼"

msgid "Write plain PHP — no opening tag needed. The code is checked for syntax errors before it is saved, and if it ever crashes a page Horse Tools switches it off automatically."
msgstr "编写普通 PHP 代码即可——无需开头标签。代码在保存前会先检查语法错误，若它曾导致某页面崩溃，Horse Tools 会自动将其关闭。"

msgid "Write your block just like a post: type text and use the toolbar to insert links, images and formatting. Need raw HTML/CSS/JS? Switch to the “Text” tab. Placeholders like {{url}} still work in both."
msgstr "像撰写文章一样编写您的模块：输入文字，并使用工具栏插入链接、图片和格式。需要原始 HTML/CSS/JS？请切换到“文本”标签页。{{url}} 之类的占位符在两种模式下都可正常使用。"

msgid "Wrong answer to the security question."
msgstr "安全问题的答案错误。"

msgid "You are not allowed to change these settings."
msgstr "您无权更改这些设置。"

msgid "You are not allowed to use PHP snippets."
msgstr "您无权使用 PHP 代码片段。"

msgid "You may send as any address on a domain you have verified with this service. An unverified one will be refused."
msgstr "您可以以您在此服务中已验证域名下的任意地址发送邮件。未验证的地址将被拒绝。"

msgid "You would be told if this site went quiet"
msgstr "如果本站变得毫无动静，您会收到通知"

msgid "Your Telegram chat ID (for recovery codes)"
msgstr "您的 Telegram Chat ID（用于恢复代码）"

msgid "Your approvals match their copy on disk"
msgstr "您的批准情况与磁盘上的副本一致"

msgid "Your check-in message only got through on the backup route (%s). Your main channel is not working, and you have one left instead of two."
msgstr "您的签到消息仅通过了备用渠道（%s）送达。您的主渠道未能正常工作，目前只剩一个渠道而非两个。"

msgid "Your contact details have changed."
msgstr "您的联系方式已发生变化。"

msgid "Your container has no GA4 tag in it, so Tag Manager has nothing to pass the click on to. It is placed in the dataLayer and stops there until you build the tag below — until then nothing reaches Analytics."
msgstr "您的容器中没有 GA4 标签，因此 Tag Manager 无处传递该点击。它会被放入 dataLayer 并停留在那里，直到您在下方创建该标签为止——在此之前，任何内容都不会到达 Analytics。"

msgid "Your content has not been read all the way through yet (%1$d of %2$d), so nothing found in it can be trusted as complete."
msgstr "您的内容尚未被完整读取（%1$d / %2$d），因此其中发现的任何内容都不能视为完整可信。"

msgid "Your content has not been read all the way through yet."
msgstr "您的内容尚未被完整读取。"

msgid "Your content links to %1$s domains you have not agreed to, and %2$s you have. You will be told the moment one arrives that is on neither list."
msgstr "您的内容链接到 %1$s 个您尚未同意的域名，以及 %2$s 个您已同意的域名。一旦出现既不在同意列表也不在拒绝列表中的域名，您将立即收到通知。"

msgid "Your content links to %d domain you have not approved."
msgstr "您的内容链接到 %d 个您尚未批准的域名。"

msgid "Your content links to more domains than the list can hold, so it is incomplete"
msgstr "您的内容链接到的域名数量超出列表可容纳的上限，因此该列表并不完整"

msgid "Your content links to more than %d domains, which is as many as can be held. Domains beyond that were not recorded, so this cannot tell you when one of them is new — it would say it was already there."
msgstr "您的内容链接到超过 %d 个域名，这已是可容纳的最大数量。超出部分未被记录，因此本功能无法告诉您其中某个是否为新出现的域名——它只会显示为“早已存在”。"

msgid "Your domain already receives mail through %1$s, so choose %2$s below. Sending through the service that already handles your mail is the one most likely to work first time."
msgstr "您的域名已经通过 %1$s 接收邮件，因此请在下方选择 %2$s。通过已在处理您邮件的服务发送，是最有可能一次成功的方式。"

msgid "Your domain does not say which servers are allowed to send mail for it. Anyone can send mail claiming to be you, and mail you really did send has nothing to vouch for it — Gmail and Yahoo both treat that as a reason for suspicion."
msgstr "您的域名没有指明哪些服务器被授权代为发信。任何人都能以您的名义发送邮件，而您真正发出的邮件却没有任何东西为其背书——Gmail 和 Yahoo 都会将此视为可疑的理由。"

msgid "Your domain has a list of allowed senders, but it could not be worked out from here whether this server is on it."
msgstr "您的域名有一份授权发信服务器列表，但从这里无法判断此服务器是否在列表之中。"

msgid "Your domain has no DMARC record, so you are never told when somebody sends mail pretending to be you, and receivers have no instruction about what to do with it."
msgstr "您的域名没有 DMARC 记录，因此当有人冒充您发送邮件时，您永远不会收到通知，收件方也没有任何关于如何处理此类邮件的指引。"

msgid "Your domain receives mail through %s. Sending through the same service is the setting most likely to work, because it is already on your domain’s list of allowed senders."
msgstr "您的域名通过 %s 接收邮件。通过同一服务发送是最有可能成功的设置，因为它已经在您域名的授权发信服务器列表中。"

msgid "Your domain says which servers may send mail for it, and this site is sending straight from the web server. Whether that server is on the list could not be determined here."
msgstr "您的域名指明了哪些服务器可以代为发信，而本站正是直接从 Web 服务器发送邮件。此处无法判断该服务器是否在列表之中。"

msgid "Your email settings changed after the last test, so what is running now has not been tried"
msgstr "您的邮件设置在上次测试后发生了变化，因此当前运行的配置尚未经过测试"

msgid "Your host can attach a name to the address — ask them for “reverse DNS” or a “PTR record”. Or sidestep it entirely by sending through an email service, whose own servers already have one."
msgstr "您的主机可以为该地址绑定一个名称——向其索取“反向 DNS”或“PTR 记录”。或者完全绕开这个问题，改用邮件服务发送，其自身服务器早已配置好这类记录。"

msgid "Your last test landed in the spam folder"
msgstr "您上次的测试落入了垃圾邮件文件夹"

msgid "Your last test never arrived"
msgstr "您上次的测试从未送达"

msgid "Your login recovery code"
msgstr "您的登录恢复代码"

msgid "Your one-time login code for %1$s is: %2$s (valid 10 minutes)."
msgstr "您用于 %1$s 的一次性登录代码为：%2$s（10 分钟内有效）。"

msgid "Your own account must have two-factor authentication switched on before you can use PHP snippets."
msgstr "在您能够使用 PHP 代码片段之前，您自己的账户必须先开启双重验证。"

msgid "Your own icon (paste an SVG)"
msgstr "您自己的图标（粘贴一个 SVG）"

msgid "Your pages go out exactly as written."
msgstr "您的页面会完全按照所写内容原样输出。"

msgid "Your pairing code has expired. Reload this page to get a new one."
msgstr "您的配对代码已过期。请重新加载此页面以获取新的代码。"

msgid "Your posts and pages do not link anywhere outside this site."
msgstr "您的文章和页面没有链接到本站以外的任何地方。"

msgid "Your posts and pages link to %d other domain. Go through it once and confirm which ones belong there; after that, a domain that was not on the list is worth one sentence on your screen instead of two years of nobody noticing."
msgstr "您的文章和页面链接到 %d 个其他域名。请过一遍并确认哪些属于合理链接；此后，一个不在列表中的域名，只需在您的界面上多一句提示即可，而不必等到两年后仍无人察觉。"

msgid "Your settings already look like %s, so its notes apply to you even though nothing is selected above."
msgstr "您的设置已经与 %s 相似，因此其说明同样适用于您，即使上方未选中任何项。"

msgid "Your site has Tag Manager but no Google tag — one setup step is required"
msgstr "您的网站装有 Tag Manager 但没有 Google 标签——还需要完成一步设置"

msgid "Your site loads the Google tag, so a click goes straight to Analytics. This is the usual case, and it includes sites where Analytics was installed through Tag Manager — a GA4 tag inside a container loads the Google tag itself."
msgstr "您的网站已加载 Google 标签，因此点击会直接进入 Analytics。这是最常见的情况，也包括那些通过 Tag Manager 安装 Analytics 的网站——容器内的 GA4 标签会自行加载 Google 标签。"

msgid "Zoom"
msgstr "缩放"

msgid "Zoom in"
msgstr "放大"

msgid "Zoom out"
msgstr "缩小"

msgid "[!] This went by %1$s because %2$s would not send: %3$s"
msgstr "[!] 此邮件改经 %1$s 发送，因为 %2$s 无法发送：%3$s"

msgid "[?] %1$d domain was approved over a year ago and is barely linked: %2$s"
msgstr "[?] %1$d 个域名是一年多前批准的，且几乎没有被链接：%2$s"

msgid "a bar pinned to the bottom of the phone screen. Choose one of 5 styles from the grid."
msgstr "一条固定在手机屏幕底部的横条。可从网格中选择 5 种样式之一。"

msgid "a greeting bubble, business hours (shows Online / Away), scan-to-open QR on desktop, and pre-filled WhatsApp / SMS messages."
msgstr "一个问候气泡、营业时间（显示在线/离开状态）、桌面端可扫码打开的二维码，以及预填的 WhatsApp / 短信消息。"

msgid "a panel that slides up to show your services or articles. Pick its layout, colour and how it appears from the visual grids. To open it, point a bottom-bar item at"
msgstr "一个向上滑出的面板，用于展示您的服务或文章。可从可视化网格中选择其布局、颜色以及出现方式。要打开它，请让底部导航栏中的某一项指向"

msgid "added ✓"
msgstr "已添加 ✓"

msgid "ads.txt"
msgstr "ads.txt"

msgid "an address you can open right now"
msgstr "一个您现在就可以打开的地址"

msgid "and %d more — click to see it"
msgstr "还有 %d 个——点击查看"

msgid "approved %s ago"
msgstr "于 %s 前批准"

msgid "choose how the floating button looks from the visual grid below (17 styles). What you see is what visitors get."
msgstr "从下方的可视化网格中选择浮动按钮的外观（17 种样式）。您看到的效果就是访客所获得的效果。"

msgid "click SAVE CONTENT at the bottom of the page. The Services panel has its own “Save services” button."
